## Testing your Vue Application in NodeJS

As an alternative to browser-based e2e testing, we provide an example of how you can test AG Grid using the [Vue Testing Library](https://testing-library.com/docs/vue-testing-library/intro) in the [AG Grid Repo](https://github.com/ag-grid/ag-grid/tree/latest/testing/public-recipes).

